avy package",[33],{"type":34,"text":35,"spans":36},"paragraph","Here's what you need to know about sending a heavy package with us",[],{"dimensions":38,"alt":41,"copyright":30,"url":42,"id":43,"edit":44},{"width":39,"height":40},500,132,"Send a parcel","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fbe2c756c-941a-4d5c-9ee4-e588846e0298_send-landing.svg","YiExBxIAACgAAWmC",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":53,"version":26,"items":54,"primary":56,"id":81,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},"default-slice",[55],{},{"CardImage":57,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":68,"CardText":69,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":79,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":58,"alt":61,"copyright":30,"url":62,"id":63,"edit":64},{"width":59,"height":60},1000,665,"A father is weighing his parcel at home at his desk using a set of digital scales. His children are resting on the sofa behind him.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdApbqstJ9-inY_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7772.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdApbqstJ9-inY",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},8,"transparent","none","Sending a heavy package",[70,73,76],{"type":34,"text":71,"spans":72},"If you want to protect your recipient’s items properly during transit, making sure they’re packed properly before you send them on their way is a very important step – and this is even more important if you're planning on shipping heavy parcels.",[],{"type":34,"text":74,"spans":75},"Requiring sturdier packaging and a watchful eye on its weight so you don’t make your parcels too heavy, there are a few more steps to bear in mind when packaging for a heavy item than first meets the eye.",[],{"type":34,"text":77,"spans":78},"To make sure your heavier items are packed properly so they get to their destination safely, here are our 7 steps to follow when packaging heavy items for delivery.",[],{"link_type":80},"Any","card$b6c4a6ca-a9ba-4e66-9c8a-5901e775379f","card",{"variation":53,"version":26,"items":84,"primary":86,"id":104,"slice_type":105,"slice_label":30},[85],{},{"title":87,"bodyText":88,"isEco":21,"PaddingTop":21,"PaddingBottom":92,"NoMarginBottom":21,"hasButton":92,"buttonText":93,"buttonLink":94,"image":98},"How heavy can my Evri parcel be?",[89],{"type":34,"text":90,"spans":91},"With Evri, you can send parcels up to a weight of 15kg, with a maximum dimension of 120cm in length, and a combined length and circumference of 245cm. For more information on parcel size and weight, take a look at out parcel size and weight guide.",[],true,"Size and weight guide",{"link_type":95,"key":96,"url":97},"Web","f4d11edc-b617-4e22-8aa4-1e432f07f2e7","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide",{"dimensions":99,"alt":100,"copyright":30,"url":101,"id":102,"edit":103},{"width":59,"height":60},"Customer sat at a desk holding a tape measure with their index finger to measure the size of their parcel.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R57pbqstJ9-STz_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8600.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R57pbqstJ9-STz",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"feature_banner$fe8fe9f1-6612-4ca6-8c26-88e630bd4b5b","feature_banner",{"variation":107,"version":26,"items":108,"primary":110,"id":125,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},"cardWithImageNoCta",[109],{},{"CardImage":111,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":117,"CardText":118,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":112,"alt":113,"copyright":30,"url":114,"id":115,"edit":116},{"width":59,"height":60},"A female van driver dressed in an Evri banded vest is loading a blue Evri van with parcels.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C7762%2C5162&w=1000&h=665","Z6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"1. Choose a sturdy box",[119,122],{"type":34,"text":120,"spans":121},"The first thing you need to get your hands on when packaging heavy items is a sturdy box. Standard cardboard boxes might not be strong enough to support the weight of large items, so a stiff box is essential to ensure your items don’t break through their packaging.",[],{"type":34,"text":123,"spans":124},"As an added bonus, a sturdy box also means your parcel can be stacked more securely during transport, keeping your items nice and safe until they reach their destination.",[],"card$d30df186-73e2-4640-8038-84a857d6397c",{"variation":107,"version":26,"items":127,"primary":129,"id":144,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},[128],{},{"CardImage":130,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":136,"CardText":137,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":131,"alt":132,"copyright":30,"url":133,"id":134,"edit":135},{"width":59,"height":60},"A father is measuring the sides of his parcel at home at his desk using measuring tape. His children are resting on the sofa behind him","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"2. Make sure your box is the right size",[138,141],{"type":34,"text":139,"spans":140},"No matter what items you’re sending to your recipients, it’s important you choose a box that’s large enough to fit these objects inside. So, it’s best to choose a box that you can lie the objects down in, and then tightly wrap protective packaging around them.",[],{"type":34,"text":142,"spans":143},"For additional cushioning you can use bubble wrap, newspaper, or other forms of padding.",[],"card$7c607924-49de-4591-9f71-2fda538cb481",{"variation":107,"version":26,"items":146,"primary":148,"id":168,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},[147],{},{"CardImage":149,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":155,"CardText":156,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":150,"alt":151,"copyright":30,"url":152,"id":153,"edit":154},{"width":59,"height":60},"A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, surrounded by parcels.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XssJbqstJ9-We6_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5358.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6XssJbqstJ9-We6",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"3. Wrap your items carefully",[157],{"type":34,"text":158,"spans":159},"Whether you’re sending out one item or multiple, you want everything you’re packing to be protected while it goes through our system. To wrap a parcel securely, you should use packing materials like bubble wrap and cushioned wrapping to bulk it out and prevent it moving in its packaging.",[160,164],{"start":161,"end":162,"type":163},137,150,"strong",{"start":161,"end":162,"type":165,"data":166},"hyperlink",{"link_type":95,"url":167},"how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel","card$46a6e9e4-c745-4132-94c4-18c2bae9b794",{"variation":107,"version":26,"items":170,"primary":172,"id":184,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},[171],{},{"CardImage":173,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":179,"CardText":180,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":174,"alt":175,"copyright":30,"url":176,"id":177,"edit":178},{"width":59,"height":60},"Customer sat at a desk placing their items into a box, ready to be packaged up for delivery.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R5zpbqstJ9-STu_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8570.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R5zpbqstJ9-STu",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"4. Fill up any negative space in your box",[181],{"type":34,"text":182,"spans":183},"With your items wrapped, you now want to place them in their box along with your packaging filler. This could be more bubble wrap, newspaper, or whatever you think is necessary to protect your parcel, during transit. Remember to place this padding on the base and top of your box, as well as the sides, to ensure your items are protected all over.",[],"card$6f852e8d-a640-4031-85c0-9cbe2fd70e5c",{"variation":107,"version":26,"items":186,"primary":188,"id":203,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},[187],{},{"CardImage":189,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":195,"CardText":196,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":190,"alt":191,"copyright":30,"url":192,"id":193,"edit":194},{"width":59,"height":60},"An older man is sat at a table. He has placed his parcel on some weighing scales to check the weight.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oyFZbqstJ9-cWW_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10726.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6oyFZbqstJ9-cWW",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"5. Weigh your parcel",[197,200],{"type":34,"text":198,"spans":199},"With the last of the packing out of the way, you now need to weigh your parcel to check it meets our weight limits. Evri parcels can weigh up to 15kg, which gives you plenty of wiggle room, but you’ll want an accurate reading, so you pay the right amount for your parcel.",[],{"type":34,"text":201,"spans":202},"If you have a set of digital scales, simply weigh your parcel on these and scribble down the weight they display. Alternatively, you could look online to find the weight of the item you’re sending, and then weigh the box and packing separately, adding these totals together to get your total package weight.",[],"card$35af011d-c3b9-4915-8eb5-2e4ae421c00c",{"variation":107,"version":26,"items":205,"primary":207,"id":222,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},[206],{},{"CardImage":208,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":214,"CardText":215,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":209,"alt":210,"copyright":30,"url":211,"id":212,"edit":213},{"width":59,"height":60},"An older man is wrapping a parcel. He is applying the label with tape.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oyq5bqstJ9-cWy_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C7822%2C5202&w=1000&h=665","Z6oyq5bqstJ9-cWy",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"6. Tape up all your box’s edges",[216,219],{"type":34,"text":217,"spans":218},"Now that your items are weighed and boxed, the last part of packaging heavy items for shipping that you need to worry about is taping your box up with parcel tape or something equally as sturdy.",[],{"type":34,"text":220,"spans":221},"After placing a copy of your name, phone number, address, and parcel destination inside, close the lid and tape everything securely. You want to be sure every edge of your parcel is taped, as well as its lid, base, and corners, in order to keep everything together and secure.",[],"card$7b211e02-90e2-4daf-9f60-d379ac770b95",{"variation":107,"version":26,"items":224,"primary":226,"id":262,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},[225],{},{"CardImage":227,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":233,"CardText":234,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":228,"alt":229,"copyright":30,"url":230,"id":231,"edit":232},{"width":59,"height":60},"A side-view profile of a customer sitting on a sofa, with a laptop resting on their lap as they look down and smile at the screen.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XqsJbqstJ9-Wcb_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5741.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6XqsJbqstJ9-Wcb",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"7. Book your parcel’s delivery",[235,239,252,257],{"type":34,"text":236,"spans":237,"direction":238},"Finally, now that your parcel is properly packaged, it’s time to decide how you want to send it. To keep things easy, we have three quick and simple options for you to choose from:",[],"ltr",{"type":240,"text":241,"spans":242,"direction":238},"list-item","ParcelShop – Simply drop off your parcel at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops and we’ll get it to where it needs to go. No printer? No problem. You can use our handy Print in ParcelShop devices to print off and label your parcel instead.",[243,245,251],{"start":45,"end":244,"type":163},10,{"start":246,"end":247,"type":165,"data":248},207,224,{"link_type":95,"url":249,"target":250},"how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-label-a-parcel","_self",{"start":246,"end":247,"type":163},{"type":240,"text":253,"spans":254,"direction":238},"Evri Lockers – Open 24\u002F7 and found in secure locations, our Evri Lockers are another convenient way to drop off your parcel for delivery.",[255],{"start":45,"end":256,"type":163},12,{"type":240,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":238},"Courier collection– book your parcel online for a day of your choosing and print off your label, then stick it clearly on the top middle of your parcel and wait for your Courier to collect it.",[260],{"start":45,"end":261,"type":163},18,"card$59200025-a790-49ac-a308-bd46f0cdd4e3",{"variation":53,"version":26,"items":264,"primary":266,"id":294,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":30},[265],{},{"CardImage":267,"CardAvatar":67,"CardTitle":273,"CardText":274,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":293,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":268,"alt":269,"copyright":30,"url":270,"id":271,"edit":272},{"width":59,"height":60},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&w=1000&h=665","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":45,"y":65,"zoom":46,"background":66},"Send heavy parcels internationally!",[275,278],{"type":34,"text":276,"spans":277,"direction":238},"Now you know how to send a heavy parcel, you’ll be ready the next time you have to send a large item on its way.",[],{"type":34,"text":279,"spans":280,"direction":238},"And with Evri, you don’t just need to limit yourself to your local area. With our Evri international Courier service, you can send your parcels all over the world! Discover our international Courier services, where you can discover how to send parcels to the USA, China, and more.",[281,286,287,292],{"start":282,"end":246,"type":165,"data":283},177,{"link_type":95,"url":284,"target":285},"how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services","_blank",{"start":282,"end":246,"type":163},{"start":288,"end":289,"type":165,"data":290},239,262,{"link_type":95,"url":291,"target":250},"how-to-send-a-heavy-package.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fusa",{"start":288,"end":289,"type":163},{"link_type":80},"card$7d8a7d88-de16-45e7-b213-f2327cea06c0",[24,52,83,106,126,145,169,185,204,223,263],["Reactive",297],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":298,"$sclients":364,"$sglobal-basket-count":30},{"abtasty":299,"accessibe":302,"appPromoBanner":305,"autoDivertUpdates":308,"awin":311,"bulkInternational":314,"bulkSendEnabled":317,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":320,"enableBasketCount":323,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":326,"euCustomsDuty":329,"groovyAdvert":332,"newInternationalSendFlow":335,"newinternationalpages":342,"oohPreferenceFlag":346,"opentel":349,"premium":352,"savedCards":355,"smallParcelSize":358,"yourPricesDrawer":361},{"_createdAt":300,"_updatedAt":301,"enabled":92},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":303,"_updatedAt":304,"enabled":92},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":306,"_updatedAt":307,"enabled":21},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":309,"_updatedAt":310,"enabled":21},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":312,"_updatedAt":313,"enabled":21},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":315,"_updatedAt":316,"enabled":92},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102